<tr><td>EDS</td><td>Confirm elemental composition (Ag coverage, absence of contamination)</td><td>Elemental map/spectrum</td><td>Ag wt%, contaminant elements if any</td><td><span class="tag-assume">Not established</span></td><td><span class="tag-assume">Not established as completed</span></td></tr>
